Description: Provides tools for estimating state-dependent reservoir release
    policies using reservoir storage or elevation rule curves, seasonal
    inflow weighting, and user-defined operational constraints. The package
    supports inflow data from USGS and CDEC gages, as well as user-supplied
    data from other countries and data providers.
